      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "President Vance, Section 4 isn't just a cost; it's the strategic filter that ensures these subsidies only benefit top-tier domestic manufacturers who meet strict stewardship standards. This \"Tier 2\" requirement effectively prevents subsidy leakage to offshore competitors, securing long-term national resilience and protecting our clients' genuine value creation. By framing compliance as a quality gatekeeper rather than an expense, we transform a perceived burden into the cornerstone of a sustainable, secure green economy.",
